On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "Grrr!! There's just too much of it. What am I supposed to do with all this?? What the hell do you want from me?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "What? Captain told you to help me? Oh, that's the good news. Deliver this [Specialty Honey Box] to [Moradon Merchant] Shymer at Luferson Castle! Don't forget to bring the receipt! What? You've seen this honey before? It's just your imagination. So, forget about it and go, quickly! Come on, hurry!!\n\nMust be followed, at the request of the Armada sailors of Karus Regional Executive pugeo port the  traders Moradon Shire Mer to bring a box specially made honey, give, take receipt of  traders Mora."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Grrr!! There's just too much of it. What am I supposed to do with all this?? And what the hell do you want from me?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "What? Captain told you to help me? Oh, that's the good news. Deliver this [Specialty Honey Box] to the [Moradon Merchant] Clark at El Morad Castle! Don't forget to bring the receipt! What? You've seen this honey before? It's just your imagination. So, forget about it, and go quickly! Come on, hurry!!\n\nElmo Shark rad area of the port in accordance with the request of Captain Kidd, the  traders Moradon Clark give to bring a box specially made honey come take receipt of  traders Mora."

