On claimable
    If player is karus
        Show quest "Phew,,,Now I can breathe. Thanks. Please do this again next time. Let see, the next work is.....\n\nYou know what? [Sailor] Hayes did ask me for a favor. You can do that for me. Go get [Rare Fruit] from the pigs called [Tion] and give it to [Crewman] Hayes.  Don't bring it to me.  Give it to Hayes! You got it?"
    If player is elmorad
